        (size 3 3)))
    (uuid "7b7f9b0b-c1bb-4c35-b48f-af31c8c971e6"))

  (text "U13 = ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 (16 MB flash + 8 MB OCTAL PSRAM, needed for Spotify/cspot stream buffering).\\nOctal PSRAM owns IO35/IO36/IO37 -> those module pins are NC. BT UART RX therefore uses IO3 (not IO35).\\nDo not substitute an R2 (quad) module without re-checking: R2 frees IO35-37 but 2 MB PSRAM is too small for Spotify."
    (at -320.04 570.23 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "85c4ff6b-91ad-46d0-8150-15af47212836"))

  (text "3.3V_DIG BUCK - AP63203 2 A (S3, BT, SRC, mux, isolator) + 5V input decoupling. EN pulled up by R66."
