  (text "EDGE HEADERS - J1/J2 Teensy domain, J3/J4 S3 domain. Two 2x22 side by side per 60.96 mm edge. Pin map: documentation/core-spin2-change-map.md section 13. RESERVED pins carry no-connect flags."
    (at 1330 858 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 3 3)))
    (uuid "ae9668ba-c44d-48d1-9455-98fb05c482c7"))

  (text "U1 Teensy 4.1 memory: fit 2x APS6404L-3SQR-SN (8 MB PSRAM each, 16 MB total, EXTMEM) on the Teensy's own bottom-side SOIC-8 pads\\nfor loop recording, echo and reverb buffers. Optional W25Q128 QSPI flash on the second pad if 8 MB PSRAM + flash is preferred.\\nPCB rule: no parts or pads on the core top side under the Teensy footprint (SOIC-8 bodies 1.2 mm tall); Teensy sits on 2.54 mm headers."
    (at 95.25 338.14 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "b1497f7e-894b-4dcb-a1ac-5ffc9ad38527"))

  (text "I2S SOURCE MUX - U21: BT vs S3 (BT_S3_SEL). U23: U21 vs AUX header input (AUX_SEL) -> SRC Port A. One source at a time, no mixing."
    (at 1598 558 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 3 3)))
    (uuid "c9b15b9b-877c-4b63-81bc-4e2f5c8025ff"))

