  (text "J13 u.FL: DNP with the IDC777-1 (chip antenna). Fit J13 and populate U22 as IDC767 (same 60-pad LGA, pad 57 = EXT_RF) for an external antenna.\\nPCB: 50 ohm CPW from pad 57 to J13, GND pads 56/58 either side, ground vias every 1-2 mm, keep it short, no matching network (IDC767-DTS-V003 p.8)."
